    {
      "feature": "w2p-editor",
      "phase": "do",
      "at": "2026-08-24T00:00:00.000Z",
      "note": "MVP 1-9 built (Vite React18+TS scaffold at repo root, Zustand store, Fabric.js canvas, Toolbar/LayerPanel/PropertiesPanel). Found and fixed a real bug during manual QA: Fabric.js v6+ defaults object originX/originY to 'center' (not top-left), which was silently offsetting every object's position; fixed by converting between the layer model's top-left coords and Fabric's center-based coords in Canvas.tsx. Verified in-browser: add/move/rotate/align text & image layers, layer panel reorder/lock/duplicate/delete, undo/redo (incl. keyboard), localStorage + JSON file save/load round-trip, PNG export, and the mobile tab layout. npm run build passes with zero type errors. README written with run instructions and a requirements-mapping table."
    },
